<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded A.H. Belo Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 34-1/8 Friday.  </p>
<p>-- &quot;We anticipate multiple expansion over the next 12 months, given Belo's increased broadcasting presence and strong growth prospects from the company's publishing assets,&quot; Morgan said in a report.</p>
<p>-- It said Belo's &quot;currently depressed stock price allows for appreciation of 20 percent over the next 12 months.&quot;</p>
</text>
